    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3154dc6883fffa6336868fcaba4998f1.poster.avif?t=1754920184\" width=568 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3154dc6883fffa6336868fcaba4998f1.webm?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3154dc6883fffa6336868fcaba4998f1.mp4?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ethereal Odyssey</strong> is challenging 2D action-adventure platformer with non-linear exploration, rewarding curiosity and discovery, where secrets in every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lost boy awakens. The world around him shifts, twisting between the real and the imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world was once a dream is now a prison, shifting with every step. What waits beyond the veil?\u00a0A forgotten past, an unseen presence, or something far more dangerous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIMELESS ART STYLE\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/d9489077d9a2767bf184b246f0415d0d.poster.avif?t=1754920184\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/d9489077d9a2767bf184b246f0415d0d.webm?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/d9489077d9a2767bf184b246f0415d0d.mp4?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique emotional landscape of the <strong>Ethereal Odyssey</strong>, rich with symbolism, mysterious creatures, and hidden secrets. Every aspect of the presentation draws you into its dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEMORABLE CHARACTERS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3aa9fe19a6b2b43caf825d49b19d9368.poster.avif?t=1754920184\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3aa9fe19a6b2b43caf825d49b19d9368.webm?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3aa9fe19a6b2b43caf825d49b19d9368.mp4?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character you meet adds depth with hidden stories and abilities that help you progress through journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRANSFORMATIONS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/31620dea167d2d756d606d890a453b16.poster.avif?t=1754920184\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/31620dea167d2d756d606d890a453b16.webm?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/31620dea167d2d756d606d890a453b16.mp4?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the full power of the forms to unlock paths and new abilities that help you defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS AND COMBAT\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your abilities to conquer enemies and adapt in grand boss battles with spectacular animations and dynamic areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DREAM IS CALLING\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/839dc5bb33c104a8a10a908aa06a8675.poster.avif?t=1754920184\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/839dc5bb33c104a8a10a908aa06a8675.webm?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/839dc5bb33c104a8a10a908aa06a8675.mp4?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Darkness spreads, the world unravels. The echoes are fading. Time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break free\u2014or become another forgotten memory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and join our community to leave your mark in the credits and play an important role in shaping the video game. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3154dc6883fffa6336868fcaba4998f1.poster.avif?t=1754920184\" width=568 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3154dc6883fffa6336868fcaba4998f1.webm?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/3154dc6883fffa6336868fcaba4998f1.mp4?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ethereal Odyssey</strong> is challenging 2D action-adventure platformer with non-linear exploration, rewarding curiosity and discovery, where secrets in every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lost boy awakens. The world around him shifts, twisting between the real and the imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world was once a dream is now a prison, shifting with every step. What waits beyond the veil?\u00a0A forgotten past, an unseen presence, or something far more dangerous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIMELESS ART STYLE\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/d9489077d9a2767bf184b246f0415d0d.poster.avif?t=1754920184\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/d9489077d9a2767bf184b246f0415d0d.webm?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/d9489077d9a2767bf184b246f0415d0d.mp4?t=1754920184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></